<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163ED6F0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E2DF280"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A2990"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001678A0A0" style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E2D6BD0" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163EEEB0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163EE070"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163EE9F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A52C0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001DD99FD0"><tr width="680" height="40px" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001DD9A100"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001DD9A230" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 680px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001DD9A6E0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001DD9AA50"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001DD9B720"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001DD9C500" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/qantas-header-banner.jpg" title="Qantas" style="width: 680px;"></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A1C80" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A1EE0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A2620"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A2D20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A3570"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A3B60"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A4100"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A4490" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A4CC0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A4F20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Hi {!Contact.FirstName} &amp; <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">{TMC First Name}</span>,</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A5650"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A58B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A5D70"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A5FD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Thank you for your time earlier {!Contact.FirstName}. I look forward to working with you and <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">{TMC First Name}</span> to see what business travel solutions we may have for {!Account.Name}.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000027571A70"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000026CF7940">As discussed, {!Contact.FirstName}, thank you for authorising <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">{TMC First Name}</span> to release the required flight information that will allow me to determine the best value Qantas products specific to your company's requirements:</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A6AD0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A6D30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><ul data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A6F90" style="margin: 5px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A73C0" style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A74F0" style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Flights flown for the given periods (base fare excluding fees and taxes)</span></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A7880" style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A79B0" style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Destination travelled to and from (Origin-Destination pair)</span></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A7E50" style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A7F80" style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Booking and fare class (e.g. Economy Y/B/H and Business J/C)</span></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A8310" style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A8440" style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Airline flown (showing QF for Qantas and YY for other airlines for privacy reasons)</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A9130"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A9390" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A9850"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E3A9AB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Once I have received the travel data, I will organise a phone meeting to discuss the best options with all parties.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000027404E10"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000027409810">If you have any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact me.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163F04E0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E39D020">Thank you both for your assistance. I look forward to receiving the data from you, ideally by&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000027573A20" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">DATE</strong>.</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C565F80"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C5661E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C5666A0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C566900" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Kind regards,</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C567260"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C567D00" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C568530"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C5689F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C5675F0">{!User.Title}<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C569080"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C569190">Qantas Corporate Sales<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C5698D0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C569D90">Qantas Airways Limited</em><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C56FA00"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C56FB10">A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C56FD50">P. 13 10 85<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C56FF90">E. {!User.Email}</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C570BD0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C571510" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C572B90"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C572DF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/footer/QF-oneworld-logo.png" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" width="304px" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C5732B0" style="display: block;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163E9730"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163EA2F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163ED230"><td border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163EDBB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px;"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163EF830">Qantas Privacy Notice</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163E9AC0">Qantas collects information about you (including health information where necessary) to provide products and services to you, process your travel arrangements, facilitate your participation in the loyalty programs of Qantas and other organisations, conduct marketing activities and market research. If the information is not provided Qantas may not be able to provide the service requested. Qantas may disclose your personal information to its related companies, other carriers, travel service providers, organisations which provide services to Qantas, third parties acting on Qantas' behalf, various law enforcement agencies and governments around the world for security, customs and immigration purposes. Further details can be found in our Privacy Statement on qantas.com. You can gain access to the information Qantas holds about you by contacting Qantas Corporate Sales on 13&nbsp;10&nbsp;85.</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163F2B80"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163F3040" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163F3EF0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163F4150" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E2DA5D0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E2DA830" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E2DAA90" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E2DB1B0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E2DE1E0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001DD7DA20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001DD83800" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001DD87B10"><tr width="680" height="40px" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001DD87EA0"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001DD88100" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 680px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
